/Title (A transfer begins when a user creates a request from a source warehouse to a destination warehouse. The system validates that sufficient stock exists, and an authorised manager approves or rejects the request. After approval the goods are dispatched, and the stock is deducted from the source warehouse and shown as in transit. When the destination warehouse confirms receipt, the stock is added to the destination warehouse. All of these steps are recorded in transaction and audit tables, and database transactions guarantee that stock is never deducted without being added, or the reverse.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4056 0 R
/Prev 4694 0 R
/Next 4645 0 R
>>
endobj
